OL,3,AWhat independence could mean for
OL,4,Aoil-rich Alberta's economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Alberta independence supporter
OL,7,FKeith Wilson, the western Canadian
OL,8,Fprovince is in a league of its own.
OL,10,FWith its wealth of rich oil and gas
OL,11,Freserves, a significant agricultural
OL,12,Fsector and a young and skilled
OL,13,Fworkforce, its economy is one to be
OL,14,Freckoned with, says Wilson.
OL,16,FThe province will hold a referendum on
OL,17,F19 October, giving residents two
OL,18,Foptions: vote to stay in Canada, or
OL,19,Fvote to move ahead with a formal
OL,20,Fbinding referendum on independence at a
OL,21,Flater date.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
